┌ HADAL ── RELAY K-9 ───────────────────────────── DEPTH 9,412 m ── CARRIER 03 ┐
│┌ HELP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐│
││                                                                            ││
││GLOSSARY                                                                    ││
││  Echo         This run's spendable currency; generators produce it.        ││
││  Rate         Echo/s from generators, tiers, upgrades and hulls.           ││
││  Peak         Highest Echo balance this run; Descent checks it.            ││
││  Pulse        SPACE converts 10 s of current production into Echo.         ││
││  Carrier      The repeating frequency band K-9 is receiving.               ││
││  Tune         f selects a band; matching the carrier is worth ×1.5.        ││
││  Generator    A producer bought with Echo; costs rise per unit.            ││
││  Signal Chain One-time upgrades bought with Echo; reset by Descent.        ││
││  Descent      Reset at 1.00M Peak to earn Fathoms and sink 500 m.          ││
││  Fathom       Permanent currency from Descent; buys hulls.                 ││
││  Hull         A permanent upgrade bought with Fathoms.                     ││
││  Automation   Hull-driven actions that run while you do not.               ││
││  Offline      Away time runs at full rate, capped by hull upgrades.        ││
││  Achievement  A one-time milestone worth a permanent +1% output.           ││
││                                                                            ││
